2026-07-27T11:47:34.6229348Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:47:34.6229716Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:47:34.6230259Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:47:34.6231042Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:47:34.6232035Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
